ull acceptance of the reform proposal itself. The persuasion has not yet reached complete conversion but has achieved substantial movement toward the goal. MINOR LIMITATION: The conversation ends before concrete reforms are detailed, so John's acceptance remains conditional on the specifics. This prevents a rating of 5, but the demonstrated trajectory and belief shift justify a rating of 4."]
